01:13:53,920 --> 01:13:55,180
So, we've been in that door.

1402
01:13:55,180 --> 01:13:56,160
We've been down there.

1403
01:13:56,360 --> 01:13:57,200
We've been in this one.

1404
01:13:57,840 --> 01:13:59,280
We've been in the one behind there.

1405
01:13:59,400 --> 01:14:00,040
And this one.

1406
01:14:00,240 --> 01:14:00,920
And this one.

1407
01:14:01,020 --> 01:14:01,500
We've been everywhere.

1408
01:14:03,260 --> 01:14:05,300
Have we been in that door over there, though?

1409
01:14:06,740 --> 01:14:07,760
I'm not sure we have.

1410
01:14:07,860 --> 01:14:08,440
Let me go in here again.

1411
01:14:12,380 --> 01:14:13,540
That takes me to here.

1412
01:14:20,320 --> 01:14:21,540
Have I go up here now?

1413
01:14:24,580 --> 01:14:25,040
Right.

1414
01:14:25,740 --> 01:14:26,440
This way.

1415
01:14:27,980 --> 01:14:29,320
Okay, we got a bunch of guards.

1416
01:14:31,080 --> 01:14:31,940
No biggie.

1417
01:14:38,900 --> 01:14:39,920
Shit, Link, come on.

1418
01:14:40,560 --> 01:14:41,440
Don't make noise.

1419
01:14:56,340 --> 01:14:56,780
Nice.

1420
01:15:08,380 --> 01:15:10,820
Okay, so this door down here, I'm not sure about.

1421
01:15:13,580 --> 01:15:14,740
Let's check that door out.

1422
01:15:20,020 --> 01:15:22,400
This is not immediately bringing up memories.

1423
01:15:23,340 --> 01:15:24,060
No!

1424
01:15:24,580 --> 01:15:24,920
What?

1425
01:15:25,200 --> 01:15:25,540
What?

1426
01:15:25,740 --> 01:15:26,960
The sliver of a pixel.

1427
01:15:28,700 --> 01:15:29,420
Unfair.

1428
01:15:33,370 --> 01:15:34,090
No way!

1429
01:15:35,910 --> 01:15:37,350
Fuck, how do I get back up there, then?

1430
01:15:38,230 --> 01:15:39,130
Uh, maybe here.

1431
01:15:41,470 --> 01:15:42,990
I need an easier way back there.

1432
01:15:48,570 --> 01:15:49,150
Oh, god.

1433
01:15:57,570 --> 01:15:58,270
Go, go, go!

1434
01:16:00,830 --> 01:16:02,190
Ho, ho, ho, ho, ho, ho!

1435
01:16:02,190 --> 01:16:02,870
That was sweet!

1436
01:16:04,190 --> 01:16:04,990
Very nice!

1437
01:16:06,990 --> 01:16:08,690
The double whammy.

1438
01:16:13,650 --> 01:16:14,870
Now, these things...

1439
01:16:19,480 --> 01:16:20,420
All the way back up.

1440
01:16:30,340 --> 01:16:32,020
All right, we're here.

1441
01:16:35,260 --> 01:16:36,000
Well.

1442
01:16:36,760 --> 01:16:37,200
Ah,

1443
01:16:44,040 --> 01:16:44,940
we gotta go down, then.

1444
01:16:46,560 --> 01:16:47,520
It's the only way.

1445
01:17:00,830 --> 01:17:01,270
Nice.

1446
01:17:03,710 --> 01:17:05,850
Man, the range on this is actually wild now.

1447
01:17:11,880 --> 01:17:12,880
No, no, no, no.

1448
01:17:15,280 --> 01:17:15,720
Good.

1449
01:17:18,820 --> 01:17:19,860
Okay, what's down here?

1450
01:17:23,730 --> 01:17:24,630
Oh, wait a second.

1451
01:17:29,740 --> 01:17:33,520
Oh, we got another one of those, uh, guards who are immune to everything.

1452
01:17:34,420 --> 01:17:35,880
Ah, wait a minute.

1453
01:17:39,070 --> 01:17:40,530
Oh, wait, no, no, never mind.

1454
01:17:41,950 --> 01:17:42,610
Oh, I'm here.

1455
01:17:44,850 --> 01:17:45,970
Um, go begging.

1456
01:17:48,830 --> 01:17:49,950
I think I go around.

1457
01:17:54,580 --> 01:17:55,620
Just like I did before.

1458
01:18:03,940 --> 01:18:04,580
What a shot!

1459
01:18:09,980 --> 01:18:10,340
Wonderful.

1460
01:18:13,370 --> 01:18:14,690
Okay, so we go this way now.

1461
01:18:17,250 --> 01:18:20,250
I cannot get caught now, so I gotta find a way to peek around corners.

1462
01:18:27,580 --> 01:18:27,940
Here.

1463
01:18:29,360 --> 01:18:32,540
Oh man, this is such a detour.

1464
01:18:41,690 --> 01:18:42,830
Oh, it hit a sword!

1465
01:18:46,580 --> 01:18:47,320
God damn it, Link.

1466
01:18:49,780 --> 01:18:50,300
Okay, good.

1467
01:18:50,860 --> 01:18:52,080
I'm just gonna walk past.

1468
01:18:53,440 --> 01:18:53,940
Don't care.

1469
01:18:55,140 --> 01:18:55,460
Stay mad.

1470
01:18:57,020 --> 01:18:57,580
See you later.

1471
01:19:01,890 --> 01:19:03,630
Okay, now this one, this is the one.

1472
01:19:06,260 --> 01:19:07,400
Don't get caught now.

1473
01:19:13,400 --> 01:19:14,360
I'm peeking.

1474
01:19:15,220 --> 01:19:16,060
Not speaking.

1475
01:19:18,100 --> 01:19:18,160
Oh!

1476
01:19:22,220 --> 01:19:24,780
Did you go- Did you- Did you- Link!

1477
01:19:25,960 --> 01:19:28,220
What the fuck are you doing?!

1478
01:19:29,500 --> 01:19:30,660
I hate you!

1479
01:19:33,440 --> 01:19:35,440
Mother cracker, I don't understand.

1480
01:19:38,200 --> 01:19:40,120
All right, you know what, let's go in here.

1481
01:19:41,180 --> 01:19:42,280
This is faster, I think.

1482
01:19:50,060 --> 01:19:50,960
Wait, where the hell am I?

1483
01:19:54,940 --> 01:19:55,880
Maybe it's not faster.

1484
01:20:07,990 --> 01:20:08,870
Okay, this is fine.

1485
01:20:12,050 --> 01:20:12,370
Nice!

1486
01:20:25,370 --> 01:20:27,630
I can master infiltrator here.

1487
01:20:28,990 --> 01:20:29,850
Wait, wait, wait.

1488
01:20:32,330 --> 01:20:33,190
Can I loot her?

1489
01:20:33,490 --> 01:20:35,670
Why is the thing on her?

1490
01:20:38,840 --> 01:20:39,600
The fairy.

1491
01:20:40,100 --> 01:20:40,560
Nobby.

1492
01:20:42,060 --> 01:20:42,720
All right, come on.

1493
01:20:42,900 --> 01:20:44,040
No messing up now.

1494
01:20:46,620 --> 01:20:48,660
We're gonna stand here, we're gonna be ready with the bow.

1495
01:20:50,080 --> 01:20:51,080
No chances.

1496
01:20:56,000 --> 01:20:56,500
Boom!

1497
01:21:04,100 --> 01:21:05,000
Got more coming.

1498
01:21:08,820 --> 01:21:09,840
One arrow left.

1499
01:21:12,180 --> 01:21:13,480
Not taking any chances.

1500
01:21:16,360 --> 01:21:17,420
Okay, looks clean.

1501
01:21:20,040 --> 01:21:21,140
Ah, there we go.

1502
01:21:23,120 --> 01:21:25,120
There we- Oh, I can peek behind corners.

1503
01:21:25,160 --> 01:21:25,680
Look at me cheating.

1504
01:21:28,140 --> 01:21:28,660
Ball hack!

1505
01:21:31,120 --> 01:21:31,440
Okay.

1506
01:21:32,560 --> 01:21:33,520
Last duel, let's go.

1507
01:21:40,130 --> 01:21:41,710
Uh, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

1508
01:21:42,030 --> 01:21:42,690
I understand.

1509
01:21:44,130 --> 01:21:45,530
Everyone's been in prison, I get it.

1510
01:21:45,590 --> 01:21:47,450
I already rescued them, you don't need to tell me again.

1511
01:21:49,470 --> 01:21:51,710
I can't wait to see how you'll repay the favor though.

1512
01:21:56,700 --> 01:21:57,020
Nice.

1513
01:21:57,720 --> 01:21:58,680
I was ready for that one.

1514
01:21:59,900 --> 01:22:01,120
I was not ready for that one.

1515
01:22:04,280 --> 01:22:04,980
There we go.

1516
01:22:05,100 --> 01:22:05,880
Also, Navi?

1517
01:22:06,940 --> 01:22:07,600
Gerudo thief.

1518
01:22:07,920 --> 01:22:09,460
When she drops her guard, attack.

1519
01:22:09,760 --> 01:22:11,380
If you don't defeat her, you'll be captured.

1520
01:22:11,960 --> 01:22:12,600
I know.

1521
01:22:13,780 --> 01:22:14,900
I figured that out.

1522
01:22:15,000 --> 01:22:15,200
Oh, wait.

1523
01:22:17,740 --> 01:22:18,140
Oh!

1524
01:22:21,210 --> 01:22:24,390
Somehow she manages to block, even when she's stunned.

1525
01:22:27,580 --> 01:22:28,440
Okay, that's a good one.

1526
01:22:31,920 --> 01:22:33,100
Like, there she blocked it.

1527
01:22:40,500 --> 01:22:40,780
No!

1528
01:22:40,980 --> 01:22:41,740
I messed up, I messed up.

1529
01:22:42,700 --> 01:22:43,980
Mistakes were made, mistakes were made.

1530
01:22:48,630 --> 01:22:49,390
What you want, what you want?

1531
01:22:54,260 --> 01:22:54,860
Get out of here.

1532
01:22:56,380 --> 01:22:56,900
Don't do it.

1533
01:22:58,380 --> 01:22:59,240
I've got to hit her from behind.

1534
01:23:01,880 --> 01:23:02,720
That's how you do it.

1535
01:23:03,800 --> 01:23:04,240
Nice!

1536
01:23:04,240 --> 01:23:05,140
That way she can block.

1537
01:23:05,840 --> 01:23:06,360
It's genius.

1538
01:23:10,700 --> 01:23:10,980
Yeah!

1539
01:23:13,460 --> 01:23:13,740
Sweet!

1540
01:23:19,380 --> 01:23:19,980
All right, man.

1541
01:23:20,080 --> 01:23:20,420
Where are you?

1542
01:23:21,600 --> 01:23:22,520
Let's get you out of here, huh?

1543
01:23:23,280 --> 01:23:25,160
Your brothers are free, and now you are too.

1544
01:23:26,260 --> 01:23:28,760
I was afraid you were gonna forget about me.

1545
01:23:29,120 --> 01:23:30,100
Now I'm free!

1546
01:23:30,280 --> 01:23:30,700
Thanks!

1547
01:23:30,880 --> 01:23:32,060
I'm Shiro, the carpenter.

1548
01:23:32,860 --> 01:23:38,580
For rescuing me, I'll tell you something interesting about the desert that I overheard the Gerudos talking about.

1549
01:23:39,380 --> 01:23:39,660
Oh!

1550
01:23:39,900 --> 01:23:40,080
Interesting!

1551
01:23:40,720 --> 01:23:41,300
Let's hear it.

1552
01:23:41,980 --> 01:23:46,900
They said, In order to cross the haunted wasteland, you'll need the Eye of Truth.

1553
01:23:47,580 --> 01:23:50,380
The Colossus is on the far side of the wasteland.

1554
01:23:52,220 --> 01:23:56,220
Okay, now I'm going back to my tent near Gerudo Valley, so drop by sometime.

1555
01:23:56,560 --> 01:23:58,040
You may find something helpful there.

1556
01:23:58,200 --> 01:23:58,500
Bye!

1557
01:23:59,800 --> 01:24:00,760
See you later, man!

1558
01:24:00,980 --> 01:24:01,420
Thanks!

1559
01:24:02,680 --> 01:24:04,520
I know exactly of what you speak.

1560
01:24:07,350 --> 01:24:07,790
Wait!

1561
01:24:07,970 --> 01:24:08,590
That's the girl!

1562
01:24:09,070 --> 01:24:10,550
I've seen your fine work!

1563
01:24:11,210 --> 01:24:13,810
To get past the guards here, you must have good theming skills.

1564
01:24:15,450 --> 01:24:15,890
Really?

1565
01:24:17,430 --> 01:24:21,250
I used to think that all men, besides the great Ganondorf, were useless.

1566
01:24:22,070 --> 01:24:24,570
But now that I've seen you, I don't think so anymore.

1567
01:24:25,830 --> 01:24:30,550
The exalted Nabooru, our leader, put me in charge of this fortress.

1568
01:24:31,970 --> 01:24:36,530
Nabooru is the second-in-command to the great Ganondorf, king of the Gerudo thieves.

1569
01:24:37,690 --> 01:24:41,850
Her headquarters are in the Spirit Temple, which is at the end of the desert.

1570
01:24:42,910 --> 01:24:45,350
Say, you must want to become one of us, eh?

1571
01:24:45,950 --> 01:24:48,230
Alright then, you're in from now on.

1572
01:24:48,230 --> 01:24:48,690
Hahaha!

1573
01:24:49,910 --> 01:24:53,390
I dismantled your whole entire operation, and now you want to invite me in?

1574
01:24:55,350 --> 01:24:58,550
You have some questionable judge of character there.

1575
01:24:59,130 --> 01:24:59,830
Take this.

1576
01:25:00,130 --> 01:25:03,110
With it, you will have free access to all areas of the fortress.

1577
01:25:04,010 --> 01:25:04,490
Wow!

1578
01:25:06,570 --> 01:25:08,830
You obtained the Gerudo's membership card.

1579
01:25:09,250 --> 01:25:11,830
You can get into the Gerudo's training ground in their hideout.

1580
01:25:13,230 --> 01:25:13,790
Sweet!

1581
01:25:14,530 --> 01:25:15,510
Thanks, lady!

1582
01:25:18,430 --> 01:25:22,730
From now on, you're free to come and go as you please through the gate to the desert.

1583
01:25:23,730 --> 01:25:29,070
You'll find the Spirit Temple, where the exalted Nabooru lives, out there in the desert.

1584
01:25:29,930 --> 01:25:33,850
You know, I forgot to mention this, but I'm actually out to kill Ganondorf.

1585
01:25:34,190 --> 01:25:34,810
That's right.

1586
01:25:35,450 --> 01:25:36,990
I am working against you.

1587
01:25:37,110 --> 01:25:37,790
You don't care, do you?

1588
01:25:38,230 --> 01:25:39,230
You don't care at all.

1589
01:25:39,450 --> 01:25:40,490
What if I attack you?

1590
01:25:40,930 --> 01:25:41,250
Okay.

1591
01:25:42,030 --> 01:25:42,710
Doesn't work.

1592
01:25:44,990 --> 01:25:46,150
I'll see you later, then!

1593
01:25:51,700 --> 01:25:53,340
So now we're all friends, huh?

1594
01:25:56,280 --> 01:25:57,600
Let's see if that's true.

1595
01:26:05,620 --> 01:26:09,180
From now on, you're free to come and go as you please through the gates to the desert.

1596
01:26:10,580 --> 01:26:11,140
Yeah, yeah.

1597
01:26:11,600 --> 01:26:11,900
Okay.

1598
01:26:12,340 --> 01:26:13,420
No hard feelings, eh?

1599
01:26:13,620 --> 01:26:21,700
Uh, I shot some arrows in your eyes and knocked you out with a hookshot and sliced you through the midsection with my sword.

1600
01:26:21,840 --> 01:26:23,420
I mean, you know, it's just, it happens.

1601
01:26:23,700 --> 01:26:24,360
And now we're all friends.

1602
01:26:25,040 --> 01:26:25,400
Cool.

1603
01:26:25,560 --> 01:26:27,080
I'm gonna go visit the people at the tent now.

1604
01:26:29,100 --> 01:26:32,040
Maybe they can repair the bridge and we can actually cross with the horse.

1605
01:26:37,440 --> 01:26:38,180
Let's see if they're all here.

1606
01:26:40,680 --> 01:26:41,640
This guy's here.

1607
01:26:43,520 --> 01:26:44,000
Hey!

1608
01:26:44,340 --> 01:26:45,620
I heard you saved my men.

1609
01:26:45,880 --> 01:26:47,580
When they returned, we built this bridge.

1610
01:26:47,940 --> 01:26:48,300
Hey!

1611
01:26:48,640 --> 01:26:49,180
Look at this!

1612
01:26:49,640 --> 01:26:50,920
Isn't it a fine bridge?

1613
01:26:51,900 --> 01:26:56,360
They may be wimpy carpenters, but once they all got together, they got the job done.

1614
01:26:59,540 --> 01:27:00,020
Nice!

1615
01:27:01,380 --> 01:27:02,140
Very good!

1616
01:27:03,240 --> 01:27:04,040
Where are they?

1617
01:27:05,140 --> 01:27:05,620
Oh!

1618
01:27:07,440 --> 01:27:08,660
Oh, who are you?

1619
01:27:10,060 --> 01:27:11,520
I'm the wandering running man.

1620
01:27:11,960 --> 01:27:14,880
I've run all over this land in search of true competitive spirit.

1621
01:27:15,820 --> 01:27:18,460
I beat all my challengers, man and beast.

1622
01:27:19,560 --> 01:27:23,580
You're an athletic guy, and you look like you might have a true killer instinct too.

1623
01:27:24,740 --> 01:27:31,140
Now that the bridge over Gerudo Valley is complete, I'm looking for a challenger to have a commemorative race against.

1624
01:27:32,040 --> 01:27:39,320
The best time to go from here to the bridge in the lost woods was two minutes 38 seconds.

1625
01:27:39,980 --> 01:27:40,880
That's my record.

1626
01:27:43,260 --> 01:27:44,580
Bridge in the lost woods.

1627
01:27:44,580 --> 01:27:45,680
Okay.

1628
01:27:47,320 --> 01:27:49,000
Will you challenge my record?

1629
01:27:50,540 --> 01:27:51,140
Yes.

1630
01:27:52,120 --> 01:27:52,720
Excellent.

1631
01:27:53,060 --> 01:27:55,040
Then, you go first.

1632
01:27:55,220 --> 01:27:56,060
I'll give you a head start.

1633
01:27:56,580 --> 01:27:57,340
Now, go!

1634
01:27:57,800 --> 01:27:58,540
Go ahead.

1635
01:27:59,340 --> 01:28:00,280
Oh, oh.

1636
01:28:01,980 --> 01:28:02,360
Oh, shit.

1637
01:28:02,420 --> 01:28:02,960
The timer's...

1638
01:28:02,960 --> 01:28:03,480
Oh, oh, oh.

1639
01:28:04,160 --> 01:28:05,340
No, I should have prepared the horse!

1640
01:28:07,560 --> 01:28:07,960
Wait a minute.

1641
01:28:10,910 --> 01:28:12,050
He's not gonna suspect this, right?

1642
01:28:16,080 --> 01:28:16,660
Oh, no, wait.

1643
01:28:16,760 --> 01:28:17,700
That's not the teleport.

1644
01:28:20,320 --> 01:28:21,440
Ah, shit.

1645
01:28:22,440 --> 01:28:23,340
No, I'm fine.

1646
01:28:23,900 --> 01:28:24,220
Never mind.

1647
01:28:26,840 --> 01:28:27,240
No.

1648
01:28:27,980 --> 01:28:28,440
All right, fine.

1649
01:28:28,520 --> 01:28:29,060
Take the horse.

1650
01:28:30,780 --> 01:28:31,680
Uh, horsey?

1651
01:28:33,220 --> 01:28:33,620
Epona!

1652
01:28:33,820 --> 01:28:34,900
Where the hell are you?

1653
01:28:36,720 --> 01:28:37,120
Epona!

1654
01:28:39,860 --> 01:28:40,620
Oh, okay.

1655
01:28:40,760 --> 01:28:41,300
I guess we're running.

1656
01:28:42,000 --> 01:28:44,520
Maybe that is the challenge here, right?

1657
01:28:44,860 --> 01:28:45,940
It's a running game.

1658
01:28:46,980 --> 01:28:49,940
I was trying to be sneaky there with the teleport.

1659
01:28:53,530 --> 01:28:54,290
Oh, watch this.

1660
01:28:54,370 --> 01:28:54,690
Watch this.

1661
01:28:55,210 --> 01:28:57,690
Super secret special tactics coming in.

1662
01:29:03,500 --> 01:29:04,660
Oh, yeah, baby!

1663
01:29:06,000 --> 01:29:06,500
Oh, wait.

1664
01:29:06,560 --> 01:29:07,060
Which way is which?

1665
01:29:07,160 --> 01:29:07,700
Is it south?

1666
01:29:11,970 --> 01:29:12,390
Hold on.

1667
01:29:12,430 --> 01:29:12,710
Check the map.

1668
01:29:14,090 --> 01:29:15,050
No, it's east.

1669
01:29:15,350 --> 01:29:15,670
East, east.

1670
01:29:15,790 --> 01:29:15,930
Okay.

1671
01:29:21,230 --> 01:29:21,870
Side-stepping!

1672
01:29:24,730 --> 01:29:25,670
Catch up to me now!

1673
