3656
03:07:19,610 --> 03:07:20,030
Wait, didn't I?

3657
03:07:25,830 --> 03:07:27,710
Didn't I fall down a hole multiple times?

3658
03:07:32,600 --> 03:07:36,800
I'm pretty sure I fell down the hole in the area with the fire.

3659
03:07:39,630 --> 03:07:40,750
Oh, that's not a death?

3660
03:07:40,850 --> 03:07:41,070
Oh!

3661
03:07:42,250 --> 03:07:43,490
Okay, I guess it...

3662
03:07:44,070 --> 03:07:44,510
I see.

3663
03:07:45,510 --> 03:07:45,950
Ah.

3664
03:07:47,210 --> 03:07:48,190
My mistake then.

3665
03:07:48,270 --> 03:07:49,150
In that case, sure.

3666
03:07:50,150 --> 03:07:51,230
All right, all right, all right.

3667
03:07:54,230 --> 03:07:55,630
Uh, Xeno Christ, no.

3668
03:07:56,230 --> 03:07:59,850
Don't tell me, because I don't know what's gonna happen in the next couple games I'm gonna play with Zelda.

3669
03:08:00,850 --> 03:08:02,110
Just, just, let me figure it out.

3670
03:08:04,370 --> 03:08:05,270
But I appreciate it.

3671
03:08:06,910 --> 03:08:09,370
That's not a death, just saying me damage when you fall.

3672
03:08:11,530 --> 03:08:11,890
Okay.

3673
03:08:15,250 --> 03:08:16,510
Gotta get the game over message.

3674
03:08:16,650 --> 03:08:17,550
Oh, that's right.

3675
03:08:17,650 --> 03:08:18,190
That makes sense.

3676
03:08:18,630 --> 03:08:18,990
Yeah, yeah.

3677
03:08:19,070 --> 03:08:21,370
And when you spawn, uh, you know, in front and all that.

3678
03:08:22,210 --> 03:08:22,770
Makes sense.

3679
03:08:23,570 --> 03:08:26,710
I'm pretty sure I did die and spawn out front, though, at some point.

3680
03:08:27,770 --> 03:08:28,370
Didn't I?

3681
03:08:29,950 --> 03:08:32,250
Oh, no, I definitely didn't get the game over message.

3682
03:08:32,350 --> 03:08:33,130
I would have remembered that.

3683
03:08:38,460 --> 03:08:39,780
The hand grabbed you.

3684
03:08:41,300 --> 03:08:42,500
That was the hand...

3685
03:08:42,500 --> 03:08:44,000
Oh, that's right!

3686
03:08:44,620 --> 03:08:46,260
Yeah, the one from the ceiling.

3687
03:08:47,240 --> 03:08:48,120
Those enemies...

3688
03:08:48,120 --> 03:08:49,560
Man, let me ask you guys.

3689
03:08:49,760 --> 03:08:50,960
You played this as a kid, right?

3690
